{
  "date":"2026-09-27","day":3,"topic":"因为兴趣学习语言","category":"学习动机",
  "source":{"language":"韩语","text":"저는 언어를 배우는 것이 좋아요. 새로운 단어를 배우면 기분이 좋아요. 그래서 매일 조금씩 공부해요.","glossZh":"我喜欢学语言。学到新单词时，我很开心。所以我每天都会学一点。"},
  "translations":[
    {"id":"ja","language":"日语","style":"初学者 · 礼貌","text":"私は言語を学ぶのが好きです。新しい単語を覚えるとうれしいです。だから、毎日少しずつ勉強します。","pronunciation":"Watashi wa gengo o manabu no ga suki desu. Atarashii tango o oboeru to ureshii desu. Dakara, mainichi sukoshi zutsu benkyō shimasu.","vocabulary":[{"term":"私","meaningZh":"我","pronunciation":"watashi"},{"term":"は","meaningZh":"主题助词","pronunciation":"wa"},{"term":"言語","meaningZh":"语言","pronunciation":"gengo"},{"term":"を","meaningZh":"宾语助词","pronunciation":"o"},{"term":"学ぶ","meaningZh":"学习","pronunciation":"manabu"},{"term":"の","meaningZh":"把动词名词化","pronunciation":"no"},{"term":"が","meaningZh":"主语助词","pronunciation":"ga"},{"term":"好き","meaningZh":"喜欢","pronunciation":"suki","focus":true},{"term":"です","meaningZh":"是（礼貌句尾）","pronunciation":"desu"},{"term":"新しい","meaningZh":"新的","pronunciation":"atarashii"},{"term":"単語","meaningZh":"单词","pronunciation":"tango"},{"term":"覚える","meaningZh":"记住、学会","pronunciation":"oboeru"},{"term":"と","meaningZh":"当…时、就…","pronunciation":"to"},{"term":"うれしい","meaningZh":"开心","pronunciation":"ureshii"},{"term":"だから","meaningZh":"所以","pronunciation":"dakara"},{"term":"毎日","meaningZh":"每天","pronunciation":"mainichi"},{"term":"少しずつ","meaningZh":"一点一点地","pronunciation":"sukoshi zutsu","focus":true},{"term":"勉強します","meaningZh":"学习","pronunciation":"benkyō shimasu"}],"keywords":[]},
    {"id":"pt-BR","language":"巴西葡语","style":"初学者 · 日常","text":"Eu gosto de aprender idiomas. Fico feliz quando aprendo palavras novas. Por isso, estudo um pouco todos os dias.","pronunciation":"Eu gosto de aprender idiomas. Fico feliz quando aprendo palavras novas. Por isso, estudo um pouco todos os dias.","vocabulary":[{"term":"Eu","meaningZh":"我","pronunciation":"eu"},{"term":"gosto","meaningZh":"喜欢","pronunciation":"GOS-to","focus":true},{"term":"de","meaningZh":"做…的（连接词）","pronunciation":"de"},{"term":"aprender","meaningZh":"学习","pronunciation":"a-pren-DER"},{"term":"idiomas","meaningZh":"语言","pronunciation":"i-di-O-mas"},{"term":"Fico","meaningZh":"变得、感到","pronunciation":"FI-ko"},{"term":"feliz","meaningZh":"开心","pronunciation":"fe-LIS"},{"term":"quando","meaningZh":"当…时","pronunciation":"KUAN-do"},{"term":"aprendo","meaningZh":"我学习、我学到","pronunciation":"a-PREN-do"},{"term":"palavras","meaningZh":"单词","pronunciation":"pa-LA-vras"},{"term":"novas","meaningZh":"新的","pronunciation":"NO-vas"},{"term":"Por isso","meaningZh":"所以","pronunciation":"por I-su"},{"term":"estudo","meaningZh":"我学习","pronunciation":"es-TU-do"},{"term":"um pouco","meaningZh":"一点","pronunciation":"um PO-ko"},{"term":"todos os dias","meaningZh":"每天","pronunciation":"TO-dus os DII-as","focus":true}],"keywords":[]},
    {"id":"es","language":"西班牙语","style":"初学者 · 日常","text":"Me gusta aprender idiomas. Me alegra aprender palabras nuevas. Por eso, estudio un poco todos los días.","pronunciation":"Me gusta aprender idiomas. Me alegra aprender palabras nuevas. Por eso, estudio un poco todos los días.","vocabulary":[{"term":"Me","meaningZh":"我（受格）","pronunciation":"me"},{"term":"gusta","meaningZh":"喜欢、使人喜欢","pronunciation":"GUS-ta","focus":true},{"term":"aprender","meaningZh":"学习","pronunciation":"a-pren-DER"},{"term":"idiomas","meaningZh":"语言","pronunciation":"i-DIO-mas"},{"term":"alegra","meaningZh":"使开心","pronunciation":"a-LE-gra"},{"term":"palabras","meaningZh":"单词","pronunciation":"pa-LA-bras"},{"term":"nuevas","meaningZh":"新的","pronunciation":"NUE-vas"},{"term":"Por eso","meaningZh":"所以","pronunciation":"por E-so"},{"term":"estudio","meaningZh":"我学习","pronunciation":"es-TU-dio"},{"term":"un poco","meaningZh":"一点","pronunciation":"un PO-ko"},{"term":"todos los días","meaningZh":"每天","pronunciation":"TO-dos los DI-as","focus":true}],"keywords":[]},
    {"id":"yue","language":"粤语","style":"初学者 · 日常","text":"我鍾意學語言。學到新單詞嘅時候，我覺得好開心。所以我每日都學少少。","pronunciation":"ngo5 zung1 ji3 hok6 jyu5 jin4. hok6 dou2 san1 daan1 ci4 ge3 si4 hau6, ngo5 gok3 dak1 hou2 hoi1 sam1. so2 ji5 ngo5 mui5 jat6 dou1 hok6 siu2 siu2.","vocabulary":[{"term":"我","meaningZh":"我","pronunciation":"ngo5"},{"term":"鍾意","meaningZh":"喜欢","pronunciation":"zung1 ji3","focus":true},{"term":"學","meaningZh":"学习","pronunciation":"hok6"},{"term":"語言","meaningZh":"语言","pronunciation":"jyu5 jin4"},{"term":"到","meaningZh":"到、完成","pronunciation":"dou2"},{"term":"新","meaningZh":"新的","pronunciation":"san1"},{"term":"單詞","meaningZh":"单词","pronunciation":"daan1 ci4"},{"term":"嘅","meaningZh":"的","pronunciation":"ge3"},{"term":"時候","meaningZh":"时候","pronunciation":"si4 hau6"},{"term":"覺得","meaningZh":"觉得","pronunciation":"gok3 dak1"},{"term":"好","meaningZh":"很","pronunciation":"hou2"},{"term":"開心","meaningZh":"开心","pronunciation":"hoi1 sam1"},{"term":"所以","meaningZh":"所以","pronunciation":"so2 ji5"},{"term":"每日","meaningZh":"每天","pronunciation":"mui5 jat6"},{"term":"都","meaningZh":"都、也","pronunciation":"dou1"},{"term":"少少","meaningZh":"一点点","pronunciation":"siu2 siu2","focus":true}],"keywords":[]}
